        ],
        "source": "Ghosh Ippen, Ford, Racusin, Acker, Bosquet, Rogers, Ellis, Schiffman, Ribbe, Cone, Lukovitz & Edwards (2002), Traumatic Events Screening Inventory – Parent Report Revised, National Center for PTSD / NCTSN; free, not copyrighted. Hebrew adaptation transcribed from the form supplied 2026-10-14 (נספח ב׳)."
      },
      "defaultOptionSetId": "yes_no_unsure",
